{"id":"c1a5f3d8-6b42-4e19-8f73-0d5c2a9e4b17","revision":0,"last_node_id":207,"last_link_id":18,"nodes":[{"id":12,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[40,60],"size":[620,600],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 背景音乐 · 无数据表版 (ACE-Step v1.5)\n\n**引擎**: ACE-Step v1.5 Turbo (StepFun / ACE Studio)\n**权重**: `checkpoints/ComfyUI-ACE-Step/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors`\n\n### 这一版和 md 表版的区别\n数据表节点已移除，改为三个官方文本框直接给值：\n\n| 文本框 | 接到哪里 |\n|--------|----------|\n| **音乐提示词** | `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5` 的 `tags` |\n| **秒数** | 该节点 `duration` + `EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio` 的 `seconds` |\n| **文件名前缀** | `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix` |\n\n要换一首曲子，直接在节点上改这三处，不用开数据表。\n\n### 参数要点\n- **纯音乐**：`lyrics` 留空即无人声；要带唱就把歌词填进该字段\n- **步数 8 / cfg 1**：turbo 权重官方配方，不要按常规 20 步调\n- **shift 3**（`ModelSamplingAuraFlow`）：官方模板值，改大更发散、改小更贴提示词\n- **bpm 120 / C minor**：氛围乐默认，可按需改\n\n### 链路\n文本框 → ACE-Step 编码 → KSampler → VAE 解码 → 试听 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n产物落在 `output/0060_背景音乐/` 下，文件名由「文件名前缀」决定。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 背景音乐 · 无数据表版 (ACE-Step v1.5)\n\n**引擎**: ACE-Step v1.5 Turbo (StepFun / ACE Studio)\n**权重**: `checkpoints/ComfyUI-ACE-Step/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors`\n\n### 这一版和 md 表版的区别\n数据表节点已移除，改为三个官方文本框直接给值：\n\n| 文本框 | 接到哪里 |\n|--------|----------|\n| **音乐提示词** | `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5` 的 `tags` |\n| **秒数** | 该节点 `duration` + `EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio` 的 `seconds` |\n| **文件名前缀** | `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix` |\n\n要换一首曲子，直接在节点上改这三处，不用开数据表。\n\n### 参数要点\n- **纯音乐**：`lyrics` 留空即无人声；要带唱就把歌词填进该字段\n- **步数 8 / cfg 1**：turbo 权重官方配方，不要按常规 20 步调\n- **shift 3**（`ModelSamplingAuraFlow`）：官方模板值，改大更发散、改小更贴提示词\n- **bpm 120 / C minor**：氛围乐默认，可按需改\n\n### 链路\n文本框 → ACE-Step 编码 → KSampler → VAE 解码 → 试听 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n产物落在 `output/0060_背景音乐/` 下，文件名由「文件名前缀」决定。"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":201,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[740,60],"size":[420,240],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[1]}],"title":"音乐提示词 (tags)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"value":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["深夜都市雨夜的极简氛围音乐，以低音钢琴单音为主，持续弦乐长音铺底，节奏极慢、力度极轻，克制而压抑，贴合凌晨三点三十三分失眠独处时的紧绷与空落。"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"深夜都市雨夜的极简氛围音乐，以低音钢琴单音为主，持续弦乐长音铺底，节奏极慢、力度极轻，克制而压抑，贴合凌晨三点三十三分失眠独处时的紧绷与空落。"}},{"id":202,"type":"PrimitiveFloat","pos":[740,360],"size":[260,110],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"浮点","name":"FLOAT","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":0,"links":[2,3]}],"title":"秒数","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveFloat","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"value":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[180],"widgets_values_named":{"value":180}},{"id":5,"type":"EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio","pos":[1240,60],"size":[250,180],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"秒数","name":"seconds","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"seconds"},"link":3},{"localized_name":"批量大小","name":"batch_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"batch_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[12]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"seconds":true,"batch_size":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[120,1],"widgets_values_named":{"seconds":120,"batch_size":1}},{"id":2,"type":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","pos":[1240,290],"size":[250,170],"flags":{},"ord